<title>ARGENTINA: MOTOR RACING-ARGENTINE GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-ARGENTINE GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
